WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:08.800
Dual-state walk. Three scenes, each shown twice from the same camera: AI on, then AI off.

2
00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:16.800
The heritage-park spine. With the flowing-light guide running, four passage bands each do their work.

3
00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:25.800
Systems down. The light is out — the tactile strip, engraved signage and stewards remain, and passage continues.

4
00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:32.300
The stitch crossing. Signals and info screens online.

5
00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:39.300
Screens dark. The ramp, tactile warnings and human guidance remain.

6
00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:45.800
Dazhongsi adoption market. Digital price tags alongside multi-channel payment.

7
00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:53.300
Tags dark. Cash and staffed counters trade as usual — help without an account.

8
00:00:53.900 --> 00:01:04.800
AI on equals AI off. A concept vision, AI-generated, not a built outcome; every inclusion metric remains unmeasured.
